abstract: Fifteen multilingual interactive AI playgrounds with standalone offline HTML downloads. v1.9.5 translates missing Vietnamese and Spanish replay action labels while preserving responsive controls and their mechanisms, and retains the Wumpus World icon key and responsive percept icons. Human learner, educator, and screen-reader validation is deferred; no WCAG conformance or validated learning-outcome claim is made.
